  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AAU  Research 2007-2011 - AAU Research 2007-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Assoc. of African Univ. (AAU) Forskning 2007-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Association of African Universities (AAU) &#xe4;r en organisation och ett huvudforum f&#xf6;r konsultation, informationsutbyte och samarbete mellan h&#xf6;gre utbildningsinstitutioner i Afrika. Aktiviteter som f&#xe5; Sida st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r f&#xf6;ljande; 1) Konferenser; 2) Spridning av information om h&#xf6;gre utbildning i Afrika; samt 3)Akademisk r&#xf6;rlighet och stipendier till forskarstudenter. Sida gav MSEK 8.5 under avtalsperioden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Association of African Universities (AAU)is an organisation and forum for consultation, information exchange and cooperation between higher education institutions in Africa. AAU&apos;s activities supported by Sida are as follows; 1) conferences; 2) dissemination of  information on higher education in Africa and 3) Academic mobility and scholarship award to research students. Amound disbursed MSEK 8.5</narrative>
  </description>
